      "id": "section-1",
      "background_image": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "INSILENCE COLLECTION"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h2",
              "text": "2025 Collection"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "This collection honors these invisible threads of connection, the silent conversations between material and memory. With time, they become part of the home’s unspoken rhythm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image-classic",
          "image": "/images/insilence-collection/CALBEROPIFS25INSILENCE-4041-EDIT.jpg",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": "",
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "We see furniture as objects that listen, absorb, remember. Because true connection is felt just as much as it is spoken."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "View the collection film here:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "url": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/WNz4bQkkHSY?feature=oembed",
          "title": "INSILENCE Collection | Albero",
          "provider": "YouTube",
          "description": null,
          "thumbnail": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "In INSILENCE, furniture is more than function—it is dialogue, memory, and movement. Come closer—there’s something waiting to be heard."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
